    "description": "Collection for the current HTTP implementation. Run requests in order to create a temporary user, authenticate it, create a sale, exercise the sale endpoints, and clean up the user. The API uses response envelopes, flat sale request fields, numeric user enums, and Bearer authentication for catalog and sales.",
